BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-esports-world-cup@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T101045Z
DTSTART:20260706T140000Z
DTEND:20260823T190000Z
SUMMARY:Esports World Cup
DESCRIPTION:The Esports World Cup 2026 returns to Riyadh from 6 July to 23 August\, delivering a summer-long celebration of elite competition and live entertainment as top clubs and players battle across multiple genres and platforms. With a lineup spanning tactical shooters\, MOBAs\, fighting games\, strategy\, racing\, and even chess—including global favourites such as League of Legends\, Counter-Strike 2\, Fortnite\, and Rocket League—the festival reinforces Riyadh’s role as a leading hub for international esports. New for 2026\, Trackmania joins the programme\, bringing high-precision racing where competitors chase the fastest times on one of esports’ most skill-intensive stages. The Esports World Cup\, a multi-game global esports tournament and festival\, will unite the global e-gaming community\, including players\, fans\, game producers\, and publishers\, with a focus on fostering connections and collaborations.
LOCATION:Boulevard City\, Riyadh
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-esports-world-cup.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-البرنامج-الصيفي-بجامعة-الجوف-2026@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T101045Z
DTSTART:20260707T210000Z
DTEND:20260831T205900Z
SUMMARY:البرنامج الصيفي بجامعة الجوف 2026
DESCRIPTION:تطلق جامعة الجوف البرنامج الصيفي بجامعة الجوف 1447هـ – 2026م، بوصفه برنامجًا نوعيًا متكاملًا يستهدف تنمية المهارات وتطويرها، ونشر ثقافة الابتكار، وترسيخ ثقافة التطوع وخدمة المجتمع، بما يعزز دور الجامعة التنموي والمجتمعي، ويفتح مسارات واسعة لاستثمار فترة الصيف في برامج معرفية وتدريبية وتطوعية ورياضية موجهة لمنسوبي الجامعة وطلبتها والخريجين وأفراد المجتمع. ويستهدف البرنامج، الذي يمتد من شهر يوليو حتى نهاية أغسطس 2026م، أكثر من 16\,000مستفيد من داخل الجامعة وخارجها، من خلال أكثر من 50 برنامجًا وفعالية نوعية، وما يزيد على 210 ساعة تدريبية مكثفة، إلى جانب مشاركة أكثر من 300 متطوع أكاديمي وطبي، وتنفيذ أكثر من 11\,000 ساعة تطوعية معتمدة، إضافة إلى أكثر من 10 بطولات رياضية صيفية.
LOCATION:Jouf University
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-البرنامج-الصيفي-بجامعة-الجوف-2026.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-pfl-mena-fight-night@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T101045Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260710T190000Z
SUMMARY:PFL MENA Fight Night
DESCRIPTION:Riyadh is hosting PFL MENA Fight Week\, bringing together some of the region's top mixed martial arts (MMA) athletes for an exciting week of competition and fan engagement. The main Professional Fighters League MENA Fight Night will take place on Friday\, 10 July\, at the Global Theater in Boulevard City. Fighters will share their preparations before completing the official weigh-in ahead of the tournament. Held under the Professional Fighters League (PFL) MENA\, the event follows the league's signature "win-and-advance" format\, providing Arab athletes with a pathway to compete for championship titles while supporting the growth of mixed martial arts across the Middle East and North Africa. Book Now
LOCATION:Global Theater\, Boulevard City\, Riyadh
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-pfl-mena-fight-night.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-who-lived-here@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T101045Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T180000Z
SUMMARY:Who Lived Here?
DESCRIPTION:Every landscape shapes the homes built within it. This treasure hunt in Rehlaat Gallery\, children follow clues across three environments: desert\, mountain\, and coast. Each stop reveals a model home designed in response to its surroundings\, from materials and structure to layout and function. As they move between locations\, children match clues to the correct homes\, discovering how climate\, terrain\, and daily life influence the way people build and live.
LOCATION:Museum - Gallery 4
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-who-lived-here.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-zoom-in@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T101045Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T180000Z
SUMMARY:Zoom In
DESCRIPTION:A tiny fragment holds the clue. In this Praise of the Artisan treasure hunt\, children begin with a zoomed-in detail taken from a larger artwork\, a pattern\, texture\, or small visual hint. Moving through the space\, they search for the full piece\, matching what they see up close with what appears on the walls. As the search unfolds\, attention shifts to details that are often overlooked\, building observation skills through careful looking. Each match reveals the complete artwork behind the fragment.
LOCATION:Museum - Gallery 3
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-zoom-in.html
END:VEVENT
